# Hatch, floor grate, floor bars: a frame set in the floor around the tile's edge and,
# while it is shut, the lid inside it with the game's picture of it on top (and under it:
# seen from below, the shut lid stands out from its frame). Open, only the frame is left
# and the way through shows.
# (how a model is laid out: README.txt)
mtllib models.mtl
o Frame
v -0.500000 0.000000 -0.500000
v 0.500000 0.000000 -0.500000
v 0.500000 0.000000 -0.420000
v -0.500000 0.000000 -0.420000
